Node architecture constraints:

- Nodes are specialist executors (audio/lamp/pixel/etc), not alternate show engines.
- Preserve communication model: P4 authoritative decisions routed via Comms to node links.
- Preserve addressing model and ownership semantics where implemented (including GRANT/controlled-vs-standalone behavior where documented in repo).
- Preserve acknowledgement/status semantics: accepted transport is not physical completion.
- Preserve offline/failsafe behaviors per node type.
- Keep node versioning and node role boundaries explicit.
- Do not duplicate node responsibilities inside P4 or duplicate P4 authority inside nodes without explicit architecture change.
